Package: rsatemplate
Type: Package
Title: Rsquared Academy pkgdown Template
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aravind", "Hebbali", email = "aravindhebbali@rsquaredacademy.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pkgdown template package that gives Rsquared Academy R
    packages a shared visual identity: Bootstrap 5 theming, a structured
    workbench home page, card-style function reference, dark mode, a
    configurable course card, a branded 404 page, and the Rsquared
    Academy site-kit. It also provides a post-build helper for canonical
    links and a clean sitemap.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rsquaredacademy/rsatemplate
